# Telegram Anti-Dopamine - Blocked Chats Configuration
#
# IMPORTANT: This file exists in TWO locations:
#   1. Project root: blocked_chats.txt (EDIT THIS ONE)
#   2. TMessagesProj/src/main/assets/blocked_chats.txt (auto-copied before build)
#
# After editing this file, copy it to assets before building:
#   cp blocked_chats.txt TMessagesProj/src/main/assets/blocked_chats.txt
#
# Add chat names here (one per line) to block them from search results.
# Lines starting with # are comments and will be ignored.
# Empty lines are also ignored.
#
# Matching is case-insensitive and uses substring matching.
# For example, "John" will match "John Doe", "Johnny", etc.
#
# Examples:
# Distracting Friend
# Time Waster Group
# News Channel Name
#
# Add your blocked chat names below:
